~ start
do show_evil_plooy_and_hide_monk()
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "sad", true)
do change_pitch("low")
Yoolp: I thought, stopping time would fix everything..
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "sad", false)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: If we never do anything, time will eventually cease to exist in this dimension.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", true)
do change_pitch("low")
Yoolp: But I am the embodiment of your mistakes. I will always choose the opposite. The cycle will never end.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "sad", false)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: Like you said, for every choice we make, there's a timeline where it's different.
Plooy: There is a Plooy that never acts. And a Plooy that chooses to destroy.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", true)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: But what matters... is the Plooy we are at this very moment.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", true)
do change_pitch("low")
Yoolp: But the loop of disappointment will just keep repeating itself.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", false)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: The loop will never break if we choose to do nothing about it.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", false)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: What we are now is what matters... And what tomorrow becomes is our next step.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", true)
do change_pitch("low")
Yoolp: You would let Plooy make mistakes?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "worried", false)
do change_pitch("high")
Plooy: As long as we face them... [speed=0.5]Together.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "happy", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("evil_plooy", "happy", true)
do change_pitch("low")
